Package: AV1R
Type: Package
Title: 'AV1' Video Encoding for Biological Microscopy Data
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: c(
        person("Yuri", "Baramykov",
        email = "lbsbmsu@mail.ru",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-7627-4217")),
        person("The Khronos Group Inc.", role = "cph"),
        person("FFmpeg developers", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Converts microscopy video and image data (H.264/H.265,
    AVI/MJPEG, TIFF stacks) to the 'AV1' codec for compact storage, and
    archives 16-bit image stacks and videos losslessly in the 'FFV1'
    format. Encoding runs on the GPU via 'Vulkan' or 'VAAPI' when
    available and falls back to the CPU through 'FFmpeg' and 'SVT-AV1'.
    Whole experiment folders can be converted at once.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
