Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: FFmpeg (>= 4.4) with 'libsvtav1', libvulkan-dev and
        glslc (optional, for GPU encoding on Linux), Vulkan SDK
        (optional, for GPU encoding on Windows)
